    <widget class="QLabel" name="hintLabel">
     <property name="text">
      <string>The blur radii follow the longitudinal chromatic aberration of the eye (R −0.23 D, G +0.24 D, B +1.10 D). For a 1920×1080 laptop panel at ~50 cm, green ≈ 2.5 px and blue ≈ 7.0 px; start with strength 0.3 and adjust until comfortable.</string>
